  <section class="about-container">
    <div class="about-card">
      <h2>What is Bazi?</h2>
      <p>
        Bazi, meaning “Eight Characters,” is a Chinese metaphysical system that reveals your energetic blueprint from birth. 
        It’s composed of four pairs of characters (year, month, day, hour), combining Heavenly Stems and Earthly Branches.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-card">
      <h2>How is it Calculated?</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Use birth date/time → convert to Chinese lunar calendar.</li>
        <li>Identify four Heavenly Stems & Earthly Branches.</li>
        <li>Result = 8 characters (八字).</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="about-card">
      <h2>Traditional Applications</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Fate analysis & life path.</li>
        <li>Marriage & relationship compatibility.</li>
        <li>Selecting auspicious dates.</li>
        <li>Balancing health or career based on Five Elements.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="about-card">
      <h2>How We Use Bazi Here</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Analyze your birth chart to find imbalances.</li>
        <li>Determine which element you need today.</li>
        <li>Map ingredients to elements (e.g., lemon = Wood).</li>
        <li>Generate a personalized drink that restores harmony.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

